## Key Concepts
- Event-driven architecture; S3 event filtering; Transcribe with diarization; Comprehend PII redaction; SageMaker multi-task inference; DynamoDB composite keys; KMS encryption; Glue lineage; DLQ design; cross-account IAM trust policies.

## Code Example
